        "original_id": "37f66bee-bc10-5695-bf06-fe11276ee880",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Return to Never Land, McFarland, USA\n- Companies: Walt Disney Television Animation, Walt Disney Pictures, Walt Disney Studios Motion Pictures, Mayhem Pictures\n- Topics: film production, film distribution\n\nFacts:\n- Return to Never Land is a 2002 American animated musical fantasy-adventure film.\n- Return to Never Land is also known as Peter Pan 2 and Peter Pan In: Return to Never Land.\n- Walt Disney Television Animation produced Return to Never Land.\n- Walt Disney Pictures released Return to Never Land.\n- Walt Disney Studios Motion Pictures distributed Return to Never Land.\n- Walt Disney Pictures and Mayhem Pictures co-produced the film McFarland, USA.",
